  m_Name: Lore5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_5
  title: The Old Lady
  fullText: 'The lady says she speaks no falsehoods.


    But...

    Last time
    I listened to her.

    Last time I believed her.


    Both were mistakes.


    She
    speaks carefully.

    Enough truth to lead you forward.

    Enough silence
    to lead you wrong.


    If you read this then...

    Try to Remember.'
